    <title>德国创业录 | 要做时间的朋友，对话德国羽毛球协会华人主理人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6874de9460f8f77d40725968</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6874de9460f8f77d40725968</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Jul 2025 10:47:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：黄老板，老李</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：老罗</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：黄老板</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：黄老板</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容梗概：</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾老罗，是法兰克福羽毛球协会的主理人。他将分享自己在德国多年的所见所感，讲述一个资深德漂的真实生活与挑战。老罗如何平衡工作与家庭？又如何在异国他乡坚持兴趣爱好？听一听，也许你会找到共鸣或新的启发。</span></p><span></span><h3><span>🎧 时间轴目录：</span></h3><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">02:06</a></span></strong><span> 计算机系硕士的职业路径：从软媒到埃森哲，再到德国复兴信贷银行的稳定发展</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">04:08</a></span></strong><span> 节能标准与低息贷款：危机中发挥作用的支持政策</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a></span></strong><span> 教育工作的沉淀与分享：老罗跨界经验谈</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a></span></strong><span> 羽毛球协会的发展历程：从几人小组到数百名会员的成长之路</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a></span></strong><span> 德国华人协会：困难与挑战并存的十四年坚持</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a></span></strong><span> 社区协调难题：微信群公告引发的篮球场地之争</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a></span></strong><span> 三十年如一日：老罗坚持羽毛球的动人故事</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1111">18:31</a></span></strong><span> 什么时候打球？如何安排训练？儿童羽毛球培训背后的细节分享</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a></span></strong><span> 加入我们，享受羽毛球的乐趣——德国华人羽毛球协会欢迎你！</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a></span></strong><span> 德国羽毛球青训系统：挑战与机遇并存！</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a></span></strong><span> 中德青训体系对比：专业与业余的不同路径</span><br><span></span><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1746">29:06</a></span></strong><span> 欧洲足球俱乐部体验记：挑战青少年队的精彩对抗</span></p>]]></description>
